  "slug": "nf-core-bamtofastq-claude",
  "format": "gxformat2",
  "original_format": "gxformat2",
  "release": null,
  "annotation": "Translation of nf-core/bamtofastq 2.2.1 (8a29586). Converts a list of BAM/CRAM alignments\nto FASTQ: pre-conversion samtools/FastQC QC, per-sample single/paired classification,\npaired-end conversion via the source's four-way pair-class split (map/map, unmap/unmap,\nunmap/map, map/unmap), merge of unmapped classes, name-collated FASTQ extraction and\nmapped+unmapped concatenation; single-end conversion keeps the \"other\" FASTQ stream;\npost-conversion FastQC and fastq_info.\n"
 },
